      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 407,
      "ruku": 351,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3436,
      "text": "It is He Who originates the creation and then repeats it, which is easier for Him. To Him belong the most sublime attributes in the heavens and earth, and He is the All-Mighty, the All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 407,
      "ruku": 351,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3437,
      "text": "He makes this comparison for you from your own lives: do you have among your slaves any partners who equally share with you whatever wealth we have given you[10], so you are fearing them as you fear one another[11]? This is how We make the verses clear for people who understand.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 407,
      "ruku": 352,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3438,
      "text": "In fact, the wrongdoers follow their own desires without any knowledge. Who can guide those whom Allah caused to stray? They will have no helpers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 407,
      "ruku": 352,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3439,
      "text": "Adhere sincerely to the true religion in all uprightness. This is the natural disposition[12] with which Allah has created mankind. There is no change in Allah’s creation. This is the straight religion, but most people do not know[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
